# sangati/padartha — shabda extracted from .om files
# 11 entries

abhava: abhava / the-absence-of-what-was-expected-in-this-place
amsha: part, portion / an-unspecified-part-of-a-whole
dravya: substance / that-in-which-qualities-inhere-and-actions-occur
guna: quality / that-which-inheres-in-substance-without-further-qualification
karma: action-that-writes / the-act-with-mark
lekhana: writing / the-act-of-leaving-a-mark
padartha: category-of-the-knowable, thing / that-which-is-the-meaning-of-a-word
rashi: rashi / a-quantity-instance-situated-in-a-problem-the-particular-of-which-the-kosha-concept-is-the-universal
samanya: universal, general / what-is-common-across-many-particulars
samavaya: inherence / the-eternal-inseparable-relation-between-whole-and-part-substance-and-quality
vishesa: particular, individual / what-distinguishes-one-instance-from-another
